        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-disallow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Automatic' />
            <encodings>
              <text column='[federated.0vskzrt1n5a9z810mo3f10imxamc].[none:Calculation_209698860001206272:nk]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip show-buttons='false'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#787878'>Info:&#9;</run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.0vskzrt1n5a9z810mo3f10imxamc].[none:Calculation_209698860001206272:nk]>]]></run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <customized-label>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#202124' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>NOTE</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#202124' fontsize='10'>This dashboard contains details about all stamp cards that have been opened in Yemeksepeti Club or are currently active. </run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#202124' fontsize='10'>If you do not know the ID of the stamp card you want to view, you can select any status to view the IDs and names of all stamp cards in that status. All metrics will change according to selected ID.</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>Number of Accepted Users</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>: </run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#202124' fontsize='10'>Total # of users that accepted the selected stamp card. </run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'># of Potential Acceptors</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>: # of users who selected or can select the stamp card. </run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>          - Users can be counted in both Tier 0 and Tier 1 cards if the User finishes the Tier 0 card and goes to Tier 1.</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>          - </run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='10' italic='true' underline='true'># of Potential Users in AT cards reflects # of whole Audience size, so numbers are different from Tier 0 and Tier 1 user numbers.</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>Accepted User Ratio</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>: Number of Accepted User / Potential Acceptors.</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>Stamp Card Completion Ratio</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>: SC Completed User / Number of Accepted User.</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#202124' fontsize='10'>SC No Progress User</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#202124' fontsize='10'>: Users that accepted stamp card but not completed any stamp.</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#202124' fontsize='10'>SC In Progress User</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#202124' fontsize='10'>: Users completed at least one stamp.</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#202124' fontsize='10'>SC Completed User</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#202124' fontsize='10'>: Users completed all stamps in the stamp card.</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#202124' fontsize='10'>Stamp Order and User Details</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#202124' fontsize='10'>: # of users on stamps and total order placed until reaching that stamp. (Stamp No * Stamp Total User)</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-label>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='mark'>
